	(text "TP1 is located close to C83. A 5P49V5925 chip\ncan be used instead of 5P49V6965; however, the\n5925 has only a single-ended output.\n - replace C63 by zero-ohm resistor\n - remove C83\n - ground ADC_CLK_N via TP1 -> ADC operates in SE\n   clocking mode\n\nAnother alternative is the 5P49V6975 which is a\n6965 with a built-in crystal. DNL Y1 if you load\nsuch a device."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.88 128.27 0)
